Draw log for the carbin runtime checks (docs/modding/carbin-format.md, "How the runtime checks
were made"). A change to ReIGlue, the project's SDK fork (the GPU plugin), against the revision
tools/build_rexglue_sdk.sh pins (REIGLUE_COMMIT 949141169ddae6bd2a3f41c7230dae08567c4c39).
Apply it to a ReIGlue checkout (git apply), rebuild the plugin, run with the variables below.
Off unless set:

  FORZA_DRAW_TEXTURES=<file>      one line per new (pixel shader, bound textures) combination:
                                  ps <hash> vs <hash> t<slot>=<fingerprint>:<w>x<h>:f<format>:d<dim>
                                  (the fingerprint is the texture pack's: also pass --texture_dump=true)
  FORZA_DRAW_VS_CONSTS=<hash>     adds that vertex shader's float constants, first 16 draws

